# -------------------------- Gen.12.7 · THE_APPEARANCE_THE_PLEDGE_THE_FIRST_ALTAR -
# ‹וַיֵּרָא יְהוָה אֶל־אַבְרָם› (“and-see YHWH to Abram”)
